  "Azotu kış sonunda (Şubat) ve sapa kalkmada (Mart) ikiye bölerek verin; Şubattaki azotu kükürtlü (amonyum sülfat) seçin.": "Split the nitrogen between late winter (February) and stem elongation (March); choose a fertiliser with sulphur for February (ammonium sulphate).",
