  "Humik maddeler en az %60, toplam humik asit %38–39, organik madde >%80; leonardit kökenli, organik tarıma uygun.": "Humic substances min. 60 %, total humic acid 38–39 %, organic matter >80 %; from leonardite, suitable for organic farming.",
