  "Soluk sarı-yeşil, dik ve dar yapraklar; kök küçük ve etrafı ince kılcal köklerle sakal gibi.": "Pale green-yellow leaves, upright and narrow; small root surrounded by fine rootlets like a beard.",
  "Son": "Latest",
